OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme weather leaves gardeners
OL,4,Ahedging their bets
OL,5,
OL,6,FIain Parkinson, head of landscape and
OL,7,Fhorticulture at Kew Wakehurst near
OL,8,FArdingly, said he had seen a "big
OL,9,Fchange" in climate over the some 40
OL,10,Fyears he has worked there.
